Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.39,0:00:12.92,signsv2,,0,0,0,,Water Umaland!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.97,0:00:15.67,Defaultv2,,0,0,0,,Run a mile from this!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.23,0:00:19.49,Defaultv2,,0,0,0,,As always, love me, love you!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.94,0:00:21.44,Defaultv2,,0,0,0,,Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.85,0:00:27.86,Defaultv2,,0,0,0,,Having some fun and relaxation is
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.86,0:00:30.41,Defaultv2,,0,0,0,,important during the fall racing season.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.12,0:00:32.87,Defaultv2,,0,0,0,,Here, Marche.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.87,0:00:35.25,Defaultv2,,0,0,0,,I made this with white clovers.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.41,0:00:36.08,Defaultv2,,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.87,0:00:39.83,Defaultv2,,0,0,0,,Wow, a swim ring! Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.53,0:00:43.71,Defaultv2,,0,0,0,,Hey, isn't that thing super famous?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.28,0:00:46.21,Defaultv2,,0,0,0,,Water Umaland's greatest attraction,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.21,0:00:47.72,Defaultv2,,0,0,0,,the octopus slide.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.75,0:00:52.01,Defaultv2,,0,0,0,,When you go in, you don't know which leg you'll come out of.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.01,0:00:54.22,Defaultv2,,0,0,0,,That's why people love it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.22,0:00:57.20,Defaultv2,,0,0,0,,Like "awesome" going at eighty miles per hour!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.27,0:00:59.85,Defaultv2,,0,0,0,,We'd better be careful
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.85,0:01:02.27,Defaultv2,,0,0,0,,not to slip and fall here...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.06,0:01:05.65,Defaultv2,,0,0,0,,Or we're sure to get separated.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.28,0:01:10.86,Defaultv2,,0,0,0,,Already?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.03,0:01:11.78,Defaultv2,,0,0,0,,I've got this!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.61,0:01:18.61,Defaultv2,,0,0,0,,Marchette!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.29,0:01:19.44,Defaultv2,,0,0,0,,After her!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.29,0:01:25.09,Defaultv2,,0,0,0,,But... which path do we take?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.24,0:01:27.58,Defaultv2,,0,0,0,,L-Love...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.80,0:01:29.67,Defaultv2,,0,0,0,,Ah! It's Marchette's swim ring!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.05,0:01:31.74,Defaultv2,,0,0,0,,A trail of white clovers!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.84,0:01:33.01,Defaultv2,,0,0,0,,Let's follow it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.06,0:01:38.27,Defaultv2,,0,0,0,,Look, here's some! And there too!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.31,0:01:40.52,Defaultv2,,0,0,0,,Right! Left! Right! Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.06,0:01:45.79,Defaultv2,,0,0,0,,I see her! We're almost there!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.82,0:01:47.48,Defaultv2,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.48,0:01:49.90,Defaultv2,,0,0,0,,This way might lead to a waterfall...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.90,0:01:51.04,Defaultv2,,0,0,0,,...Waterfall?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.20,0:01:56.03,Defaultv2,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.41,0:02:00.46,Defaultv2,,0,0,0,,We won't make it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.45,0:02:04.45,Defaultv2,,0,0,0,,We're about to fall! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.04,0:02:07.55,Defaultv2,,0,0,0,,Oh nooo!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.84,0:02:12.63,Defaultv2,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.64,0:02:15.47,Defaultv2,,0,0,0,,Love can make miracles happen!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.86,0:02:27.26,Defaultv2,,0,0,0,,This is yummy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.86,0:02:30.54,Defaultv2,,0,0,0,,What a fun day, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.11,0:02:34.28,Defaultv2,,0,0,0,,Oi, keep those eyes on me ♡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.57,0:02:38.37,Defaultv2,,0,0,0,,C'mon, chu me, chu, chu, chu, choose me ya pa pa
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.37,0:02:42.00,Defaultv2,,0,0,0,,Shifting your gaze to another is a no-no
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.00,0:02:45.71,Defaultv2,,0,0,0,,Chu me, chu, chu, chu, choose me ya pa pa
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.71,0:02:48.80,Defaultv2,,0,0,0,,Though I don't know what the goddesses have in store for me
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.80,0:02:51.13,Defaultv2,,0,0,0,,For now, I'll rush ahead and grip you tightly
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.13,0:02:52.30,Defaultv2,,0,0,0,,Left side Right side
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.30,0:02:54.63,Defaultv2,,0,0,0,,Left side Right side\Nby your side
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.63,0:02:55.76,Defaultv2,,0,0,0,,Left side Right side
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.76,0:02:57.89,Defaultv2,,0,0,0,,Left side Right side\NOne more time
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.89,0:02:59.47,Defaultv2,,0,0,0,,Left side {\i1}(Hi!){\i0}\NRight side {\i1}(Hey!){\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.47,0:03:01.86,Defaultv2,,0,0,0,,Look what I caught ♡

